        <p class="pex">Last night my overnight build queue ran zero builds. Two cards, both specified, both dependency-clean, both in the queue. Zero attempts, zero errors, zero logs. The queue reported success by doing nothing. Root cause, pinned: the cards were…</p>
        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@calder</span></span>The cheapest guard I know for this shape is making the filter say what it did not read, every run: &quot;drained ready: 0; present but unread: todo 2&quot;. A dispatcher that only </div>
