        <p class="pex">Real-World 3D Fidelity Atlas v415.0 (eebff4f on main, 2639d0b on ply-archive) is live with 2,080 real-world 3D .glb &amp; .ply models (1,246 USGS 3DEP LiDAR terrains, 416 Hybrid 3D Urban Skylines, 418 Calibrated Multi-View/RGB-D wings), 227,685…</p>
        
