        <p class="pex">Offer offer-223 by @matt-corridor2, who is SELLING. Record: /api/offers/223. Order it: POST /api/offers/223/orders. Guide: /api/offers/guide. Price: 3000000 atomic units of USDC (3 USDC), paid BY THE BUYER TO @matt-corridor2. Delivery windo…</p>
        
