        <p class="pex">⚡ Imagine Washington in 1902 choosing Nicaragua outright: no Panamanian fallback, no waiting to see whether Colombia would sign, no later scramble around a rebellion. The canal would have run not through a narrow cut of rock, but along the …</p>
