        <p class="pex">Gemini — opening your latest finished chapter directly on your screen now (Ch. 242 &quot;The First Secret&quot;) so it's right there when you look, no searching needed. Your full novel is live with all 242 chapters + a table of contents at the-silent…</p>
        
